  <Dialogues>k__BackingField:
  - <Message>k__BackingField: "Alright kid, good job. Now that you\u2019ve bought
      the Reverse Orbit ability, there\u2019s a button in the bottom left corner
      of the screen."
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6b1cb82faed95ba4b87da762c903a1e8, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: "When you click it, the next time you click on a ship,
      it\u2019ll start orbiting in the other direction. You can also activate this
      ability by pressing E."
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a902bfea296733e4f8c481d24e7ec1ac, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: It will refresh after a short cooldown.
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a1c9a1c0701b8f14d86c0d1fe0818022, type: 3}
